- [Laughing]

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:37.454
- It’s up there.

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:40.540
- So, Justin, everybody says 

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.208
rappers wanna be ballplayers, 

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.626
ballplayers wanna be rappers. 

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:46.713
How is hip-hop culture immersed
when you were playing in the Giants?

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:49.632
- That statement is so true, just in the Giants locker room alone.

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:51.551
Every day we had rap battles, 

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.928
whether that was one versus one, 

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:55.221
a whole cypher—

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.181
whatever it may be, man

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:57.682
Listen, we did not care. 

00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:00.310
Anything was fair game, other than, like, obvious things, right? 

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:03.271
You don’t talk about people’s wives and kids. But, like, your divorced wife,

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:04.272
she’s fair game.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:05.273
- [Laughing]

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.942
- One of the bigger days in that kinda whole thing was 

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:08.902
Osi and Stray.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.445
It was kinda like a setup where 

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:14.365
Osi was like the young bull trying to kick Strahan out of being the guy. 

00:01:14.365 --> 00:01:15.784
Like, Michael Strahan, Hall of Famer, 

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:18.286
but Osi was, like, he had just signed his new deal. 

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.163
Strahan had just gotten a divorce. 

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:22.415
Literally they set up this rap battle with Stray and Osi.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.834
Stray is just like, “Yo, it’s a rap battle. Whatever.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:27.462
I’ll show up tomorrow and I’ll kick a few rhymes and be done.”

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.922
Osi took it so serious. 

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.966
He went home that day and literally was, like, writing down rhymes, like—

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:32.842
- He was writing down lyrics?

00:01:32.842 --> 00:01:33.426
- Testing them on—

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:37.305
I think he was testing them against people. 
You know, his buddies and his girlfriend and all that. 

00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:38.139
“How this sound?” 

00:01:38.139 --> 00:01:40.475
Cuz he comes back the next day super confident.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:41.768
- How you gon’ do that in a cypher though?

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.478
- Pfft, Osi a cheater, man.

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:44.312
- [Laughing]

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:48.233
- Osi cheat. Don’t ever play him in, like, FIFA, none of that, pool. 

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.110
- He can’t come on the show then.
-Osi a cheat, man.  

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:51.069
- Nah, man.

00:01:51.653 --> 00:01:53.738
- So Osi came in cheating, prepared 

00:01:53.738 --> 00:01:55.657
with these Google lines that he did. 

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:56.825
How was Strahan coming?

00:01:56.825 --> 00:02:00.537
- So Stray had, like, one of those Mariah Carey golden mics.

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:02.330
He brings his golden mic in. 

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:04.624
He brought it in in, like, a brown paper bag.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.501
So Osi prepares a rhyme. 

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:08.628
And, like, the rhyme had everything in it. 

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.213
Talking about his new deal, 

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:12.048
how he’s making more money than Stray now, 

00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:13.049
how he's kicking him out of the league. 
- Wow.

00:02:13.049 --> 00:02:14.509
- Basically saying, like, 

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:17.178
his old wife didn’t want him, so the Giants don’t want him. 

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:18.179
All of that. 

00:02:18.179 --> 00:02:19.764
We’re, like, crying laughing. 

00:02:19.764 --> 00:02:22.892
I knew it was gonna go there, cuz that's just how it is. We always went there. 

00:02:22.892 --> 00:02:25.186
But Stray was kinda caught off guard. You could see it in his face.

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:25.812
- [Laughing]

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:26.938
- Cuz he hadn’t prepared. 

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:27.897
So he gets up, man, and, like, 

00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:29.732
he brings this old mic out 

00:02:29.732 --> 00:02:31.401
and just goes in on Osi.

00:02:31.401 --> 00:02:32.193
- Starts spitting?

00:02:32.193 --> 00:02:33.027
- Starts spitting.

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:36.114
To Stray’s credit, man, Stray’s witty, man. He’s quick with it. 

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:37.073
He gets hooked up, man. 

00:02:37.073 --> 00:02:39.951
He starts talking about his deals and all the deals he’s signed. 

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:42.787
Hall of Fame, talking about his cars, his houses. 

00:02:42.787 --> 00:02:45.540
He just broke LT’s all-time sack record for the Giants. 

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.375
And ended it by saying, like, “Yeah,

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:50.253
I gave my wife a free trip to Disneyland, 

00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:52.839
gave her a few dollars, and she still got more than you.”

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.842
Basically it’s like he gave his ex-wife his chump change and

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:58.803
that money is still more money than what Osi just signed for.

00:02:58.803 --> 00:02:59.804
I think Stray won that one 

00:02:59.804 --> 00:03:01.472
cuz he was, like, off the cuff.

00:03:01.472 --> 00:03:03.057
